WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.214
"Eww! Frog tongue!" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:10.185
Roxy pulled herself from the tongue just as the frog's mouth closed.

3
00:00:10.186 --> 00:00:11.791
Snap!

4
00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:17.920
"Eww! Eww! Eww!" cried Roxy, jumping back down to the street.

5
00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:19.676
"This is so gross!

6
00:00:19.677 --> 00:00:22.349
I don't think I can—"

7
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:26.506
Another frog tongue flicked toward Roxy. Thwap!

8
00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:31.076
"Whoa!" she cried, jumping out of the way.

9
00:00:31.077 --> 00:00:33.200
Thwap!

10
00:00:33.201 --> 00:00:36.687
"Aah!" Roxy yelled, looking around.

11
00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:39.581
Giant frogs crept everywhere.

12
00:00:39.582 --> 00:00:44.282
"How am I going to get rid of all these frogs?" Roxy wondered.

13
00:00:44.283 --> 00:00:50.367
"If they were anything else—squirrels, chipmunks, turtles—no problem.

14
00:00:50.368 --> 00:00:52.396
I would just pick them up.

15
00:00:52.397 --> 00:00:56.616
But I do not want to touch any frogs!"

16
00:00:56.617 --> 00:00:59.261
Ribbit! Ribbit!

17
00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:02.878
A fat green frog with brown spots stared at Roxy.

18
00:01:02.879 --> 00:01:04.954
Roxy took a step back.

19
00:01:04.955 --> 00:01:08.582
But then she realized another frog was behind her.

20
00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:10.960
She looked in the alley to her right.

21
00:01:10.961 --> 00:01:14.144
A frog was squeezed between the two buildings.

22
00:01:14.145 --> 00:01:17.109
To Roxy's left, another frog croaked.

23
00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.963
Roxy was surrounded.

24
00:01:18.964 --> 00:01:22.517
Everywhere she looked, she saw the bulging eyes of frogs.

25
00:01:22.518 --> 00:01:24.492
They all stared at her.

26
00:01:24.493 --> 00:01:26.953
"Ugh!" said Roxy.

27
00:01:26.954 --> 00:01:30.766
"This is the grossest mission I've ever been on!"

28
00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.973
Detective Smith called to her.

29
00:01:32.974 --> 00:01:35.813
"Rocket Girl! Are you okay?"

30
00:01:35.814 --> 00:01:38.934
"Of course I'm not okay!" yelled Roxy.

31
00:01:38.935 --> 00:01:41.641
"I'm about to be frog food!"

32
00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:46.493
All at once the frogs' sticky tongues shot out. Thwap!

33
00:01:46.494 --> 00:01:51.476
Roxy blasted straight up, getting out of the way just in time.

34
00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:54.927
Below her the four frogs were stuck together.

35
00:01:54.928 --> 00:01:57.470
"Ha-ha!" Roxy laughed.

36
00:01:57.471 --> 00:02:02.990
Croak! A very slimy frog jumped into the air after Roxy.

37
00:02:02.991 --> 00:02:05.084
Roxy flew fast.

38
00:02:05.085 --> 00:02:08.351
The slimy frog hopped along the tops of buildings.

39
00:02:08.352 --> 00:02:11.571
Wherever Roxy flew, the frog hopped.

40
00:02:11.572 --> 00:02:15.390
Roxy zigzagged through the air with the frog right behind her.

41
00:02:15.391 --> 00:02:18.880
Soon Roxy flew over the lake in Metro City Park.

42
00:02:18.881 --> 00:02:22.223
"What happened to the lake?" Roxy wondered.

43
00:02:22.224 --> 00:02:24.487
"The water is purple!"

44
00:02:24.488 --> 00:02:28.563
Just then another frog leaped from behind a tree.

45
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:32.611
It smashed into Roxy and sent her crashing down into the lake.

46
00:02:32.612 --> 00:02:35.961
While Roxy was underwater, she saw something odd.

47
00:02:35.962 --> 00:02:38.930
A mysterious rock sat on the lake floor.

48
00:02:38.931 --> 00:02:41.794
The rock glowed bright purple.

49
00:02:41.795 --> 00:02:45.707
"That looks like a meteor," thought Roxy.

50
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:50.594
As she studied the meteor, she began to feel strange.

51
00:02:50.595 --> 00:02:54.582
"What's going on?" Roxy wondered, becoming dizzy.

52
00:02:54.583 --> 00:02:57.290
She felt as if she was moving really fast.

53
00:02:57.291 --> 00:02:59.754
But she wasn't moving at all.

54
00:02:59.755 --> 00:03:13.927
"Uh-oh!" thought Roxy. "I think I'm growing!"

